SUMMARY:Intermediate Ride (C) -  LC Manheim Auction Loop
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, an
 d Ride Together**\n\nRide leader: Aaron Siebert\nRide sweep: Lynn Pfeil\n\
 nAnticipated Average Pace: (14-16 mph)\nRoute: [https://ridewithgps.com/ro
 utes/27046093](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/27046093)\nThis is an Interm
 ediate C Class ride. The ride leader will ride at the advertised average s
 peed. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the main 
 goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group together with
  occasional regroupings and/or splitting into multiple groups to align to 
 pace capabilities.\n\nPlease do not join this ride if you are not willing 
 to ride with the group. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding
  by yourself and encouraged to join a faster group. If maintaining a 14-16
  mph average is beyond your current ability level\, please consider joinin
 g a slower ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring 
 water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator
 ).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC 
 Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup d
 oes not mean you are a club member. Join here [Member Signup](https://www.
 lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP
  is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduc
 t](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=25714
 8&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an incident occurs: [Incident Actions](
 https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&modul
 e_id=326137)
