SUMMARY:Covered Bridge Preview (Listrak) 16\, 31\, 66 & 100 miles
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nThis is an opportunity fo
 r club members to ride the Covered Bridge Classic: 16\, 31\, 66 or 100 mil
 e routes.\n\n**The purpose of this ride is to check the CBC routes.** All 
 roads will be marked. Please report any issues you think are confusing wit
 h the GPX files\, cue sheets\, and/or road markings by the end of the day 
 to [dstauffer4149@gmail.com](dstauffer4149@gmail.com)\, [jherr@johnherrpho
 to.com](jherr@johnherrphoto.com)\, and [bruce.j.black@gmail.com](bruce.j.b
 lack@gmail.com)\nThank You\,\n\\~CBC Committee\n\n**16 Mile Route (Pink/Re
 d Markings):** [https://ridewithgps.com/routes/56327316](https://ridewithg
 ps.com/routes/56327316)\n\n**31 Mile Route (Green Markings):** [https://ri
