 7327](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/56327327)\n\n**100 Mile Route (White 
 Markings):** [https://ridewithgps.com/routes/56327330](https://ridewithgps
 .com/routes/56327330)\n\n**Ride Leaders:** Please let us know if you would
  like to lead a group on one of the routes.\n\n**Sweeps** are also needed 
 - please let us know before the ride starts.\n\n***\n\n***Be Safe\, Have F
 un\, and Ride Together***\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bri
 ng water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 infla
 tor) and money for ice cream.\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by t
 he club' [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?
 page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) and [Rules of the Road](https:
